{"about_the_game":"&quot;Original Soul&quot; is a top-down action shooting game. There are a certain number of enemies in each mission. You need to use different combat methods to eliminate the enemies before you can complete the level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the game, there will be two different beautiful girl heroes to perform tasks. You can choose different female heroes to experience different plots.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour mission: free the world from the hordes of &quot;Mad Scientists&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe world of the future is ruled by the Z Corporation founded by a ruthless &quot;mad scientist&quot;. The mad scientist performs his experiments from the headquarters of an evil organization in a cyber city. And created weapons of mass destruction and biomechanical weapons. And the scientist has some kind of mysterious connection with the heroines.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo, now it's up to you to control the heroine to save the world from the army of &quot;mad scientists&quot;.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2573860?t=1759721434","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759721434","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759721434","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759721434","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"&quot;Original Soul&quot; is a top-down action shooting game. There are a certain number of enemies in each mission. You need to use different combat methods to eliminate the enemies before you can complete the level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the game, there will be two different beautiful girl heroes to perform tasks. You can choose different female heroes to experience different plots.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour mission: free the world from the hordes of &quot;Mad Scientists&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe world of the future is ruled by the Z Corporation founded by a ruthless &quot;mad scientist&quot;. The mad scientist performs his experiments from the headquarters of an evil organization in a cyber city. And created weapons of mass destruction and biomechanical weapons. And the scientist has some kind of mysterious connection with the heroines.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo, now it's up to you to control the heroine to save the world from the army of &quot;mad scientists&quot;.","developers":["\u539f\u9b42\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2573860/header.jpg?t=1759721434","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2573860/640026/cd0fff21af4ae64142af37b9d583d7dfa47d4bce/1750932694/dash_av1.mpd?t=1702461822","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2573860/640026/cd0fff21af4ae64142af37b9d583d7dfa47d4bce/1750932694/dash_h264.mpd?t=1702461822","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2573860/640026/cd0fff21af4ae64142af37b9d583d7dfa47d4bce/1750932694/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1702461822","id":256988694,"name":"\u300a\u539f\u9b42\u300b\u96f6\u53f7\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256988694/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1702461822"},{"